              "language": "javascript",
              "code": "head = [3,2,0,-4]\npos = 1\n\nSlow = 3\nFast = 3\n\nMove\n\nSlow = 2\nFast = 0\n\nMove\n\nSlow = 0\nFast = 2\n\nMove\n\nSlow = -4\nFast = -4\n\nPointers meet\n\nReturn true",
